    <item>
      <title>超越信息搬运：BGE-Reasoner如何赋能RAG与AI Agent的“推理之思”</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/bge-reasonerragai-agent-20250827211006675-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 27 Aug 2025 21:10:06 +0800</pubDate>
